  "title": "Old-Fashioned Apple Dumplings",
  "description": "This old-fashioned apple dumplings recipe features whole apples wrapped in pastry, infused with brown sugar and cinnamon, and topped with a sweet sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "MICKI WOOD"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:08:40-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-02-06T11:49:35-05:00",
  "prep_time": "PT30M",
  "cook_time": "PT60M",
  "total_time": "PT90M",
  "yield": [
    "6",
    "6 apple dumplings"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dessert"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 recipe pastry for double-crust pie",
    "6 large Granny Smith apples, peeled and cored",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "0.75 cup brown sugar",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "3 cups water",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Butter a 9x13-inch pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3nJT830Jqnzops_HXnDW3I7b8C8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-46232-old-fashioned-apple-dumplings-DDMFS-4x3-step-01-82a41bca7da8466aabb9dffa21ae9c11.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46232/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll pastry into a 24x16-inch rectangle on a lightly floured surface. Cut into six 8-inch squares. Place an apple on each pastry square with cored opening facing upward.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/89fuGwzW8IgFgbTcQC7JkpFcQJA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-46232-old-fashioned-apple-dumplings-DDMFS-4x3-step-02-f0871f8fee6b43cd845cf02f1421e5d2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46232/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut butter into 8 pieces; place 1 piece into each apple; reserve remaining butter for sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lUZDCWyGsZCNt87-cJijSadMW40=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-46232-old-fashioned-apple-dumplings-DDMFS-4x3-step-03-022bb22bd1b5477d92a97e47f3c39ba5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46232/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide brown sugar between apples, poking some inside each core, and remaining around apple base. Sprinkle evenly with cinnamon and nutmeg.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/z9bYk0NxKPRTtG6yT9sdFyWfPO0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-46232-old-fashioned-apple-dumplings-DDMFS-4x3-step-04-45031a5e04f9488ab62f5e53fbcb0273.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46232/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dampen fingers. Bring one corner of pastry to top of apple. Bring opposite corner to top; press together. Repeat with remaining two corners; seal. Slightly pinch dough at sides to seal in apple. Repeat with remaining apples; transfer to the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GLIuoZlyHEwz0ko5g32nFFtboOI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-46232-old-fashioned-apple-dumplings-DDMFS-4x3-step-05-b139eea79099483fbca097a09458c703.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46232/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine water, white sugar, vanilla extract, and reserved butter in a large saucepan. Bring sauce to a boil over medium heat. Reduce the heat to low and simmer until sugar dissolves, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZQvvGgjvG5vd976XWxZ8mgVz24w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-46232-old-fashioned-apple-dumplings-DDMFS-4x3-step-06-12047353180742a083b5a61d0474ecb6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46232/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully pour sauce over dumplings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Fqlz9WGrB9VBmsyCY7cKRSoaHlI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-46232-old-fashioned-apple-dumplings-DDMFS-4x3-step-07-c5a40e6be7c9451488d9f05272691233.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46232/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until pastry is golden and crisp, 50 to 60 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1siTGtwuJUyi80eqNb7x07-OJY8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-46232-old-fashioned-apple-dumplings-DDMFS-4x3-step-08-f673ce61f1fc462ea94d80455e00349b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46232/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place each apple dumpling in a bowl, spoon sauce over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SPw3xmrGZoThLOsGrHzHaNeWHsw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-46232-old-fashioned-apple-dumplings-MFS-4x3-c7be09dc5d29493eba41e771652a1f6c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/46232/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
